        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Xtremepush is a CRM and loyalty marketing platform powered by a built-in real-time CDP. It unifies customer data, omnichannel campaigns, predictive AI, F2P gamification, and loyalty marketing in one data layer, purpose-built for sports betting and gaming operators."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How is Xtremepush different from Optimove or Braze?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Unlike Optimove or Braze, Xtremepush combines CRM, CDP, gamification, and loyalty natively in one platform with one data layer. There is no need to integrate multiple vendors. Data ingestion happens in milliseconds rather than daily batches, onboarding takes 6-8 weeks instead of 2-3 months, and every operator gets a dedicated account manager with free onboarding."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What industries does Xtremepush serve?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Xtremepush primarily serves the sports betting and gaming industry. The platform also serves operators in banking, retail, and eCommerce. Customers include FanDuel, Fanatics, BetMGM, William Hill, Superbet, Kwiff, and Caliente."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does Xtremepush handle real-time player data?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Xtremepush ingests data from PAM backends via API or Kafka and from frontend SDKs simultaneously, all in milliseconds. Backend sends transactional data like bets placed and deposits, while the SDK captures behavioral data like funnel drop-off and in-session actions. This enables same-session triggers that batch processing systems cannot match."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is InfinityAI?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "InfinityAI is Xtremepush's predictive AI layer that shifts CRM from reactive to proactive. It predicts player churn across 7, 14, 28, 90, and 180 day horizons, models tier progression, and scores responsible gambling risk. Unlike black-box competitors, InfinityAI is transparent and shows why it made each recommendation."
        }
      },
